#subtitle: The American left is far from homogenous...

= Party Factionalism

Factionalism and internal division is a hallmark of the Democratic Party. Which faction shall we favor?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @socialist: We will favor the Socialist faction of the party, formally organized under the Democratic Socialists of America (DSA)
- @mainstream: The Mainstream Democrats have led us for decades now. It's too risky to change course.
- @progressive: The Progressive faction represents a sensible fusion of leftist principles and pragmatism about American politics.
- @conservative: The party has become far too left-wing to compete with the Republicans. Only the Conservatives can return us to national dominance.
- @easy_discard

@socialist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "socialist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "socialist"; socialist_strength += 10; socialist_dissent -= 5; populism += 10

The Socialists will finally accomplish real change in America, not just more neoliberal platitudes.

@mainstream
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "mainstream") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "mainstream"; mainstream_strength += 10; mainstream_dissent -= 10; conservative_dissent -= 5;

The Mainstream Democrats, such as Joe Biden and Chuck Schumer, have defined the modern Democrats, to limited but stable success. Why stop now?

@progressive
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "progressive") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "progressiver"; progressive_strength += 10; progressive_dissent -= 10; mainstream_dissent -= 5; socialist_dissent -= 5

The Progressive wing, once dominant, is now struggling to build support. Bernie Sanders and Elizabeth Warren are trademark members of this faction.

@conservative
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "conservative") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "conservative"; conservative_strength += 10; democratization += 1; conservative_dissent -= 5

The Conservative faction of the party, though now less influential than most of the other factions, is still somewhat influential in party politics. The Conservatives are the furthest right-wing faction of the party, pledging fiscal conservatism and social moderation.

@changed
on-arrival: lsocialist_dissent += 5; mainstream_dissent += 5; progressive_dissent += 5; conservative_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
